<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>SVMMARIVM.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04ad" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0028-mi-0428" color="#0a0c75">1</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. <fo:inline font-family="serif" font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">F</fo:inline>Vrtum, rapina, &amp; damnum datum, peccata <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>unt ex <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uo genere lethalia. Et licèt furtum ex <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uo genere leuius peccatum <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it cæteris,
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>quæ <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>unt contra præcepta decalogi, ex circun<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tantiis e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t grauius.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04ae" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0028-mi-0429" color="#0a0c75">2</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Furti quæ quantitas <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ufficiens ad culpam lethalem, comparatione eorum, qui non pingues habent
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>facultates.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04af" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0030-mi-042a" color="#0a0c75">3</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Furti actio an detur pro vna gallina, &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>imilibus
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>rebus, &amp; qualis concedatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04b0" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0031-mi-042b" color="#0a0c75">4</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Furtum vt <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it culpa lethalis, maior quantitas
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>requiritur comparatione opulenti, quàm comparatione habentis tenues facultates.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04b1" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0031-mi-042c" color="#0a0c75">5</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Furtum de <fo:inline font-weight="normal">quacunque</fo:inline> re leui, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i verè <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it furtum,
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>culpa e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t venialis. Et <fo:inline font-weight="normal">quou<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>que</fo:inline> obligatio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it illud re<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tituendi <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ub veniali culpa.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04b2" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0031-mi-042d" color="#0a0c75">6</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Furtum rei modicæ, quando ob damnum vlterius <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>equutum e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t culpa lethalis, cum onere re<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tituendi etiam damnum. Comparatione tamen
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>damni locum non habet pæna furti, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ed legis acquiliæ: <fo:inline font-weight="normal">neque</fo:inline> item excommunicatio lata profurte,
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>non facta mentione de damno.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04b3" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0031-mi-042e" color="#0a0c75">7</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Qui leue quid furatus e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t, cum animo furandi
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>quantitatem, quæ ad culpam lethalem <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ufficeret,
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>lethaliter peccauit. In foro verò exteriori <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olùm
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>datur actio furti pro eo, quod e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t furatus.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0028-it-04b4" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0031-mi-042f" color="#0a0c75">8</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Furtum rei minimæ, ob tri<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>titiam inde ac culpam eius, qui id furtum e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t pa<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>us, quando culpa
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>lethalis.</fo:inline></fo:block>
</fo:block>
