<fo:block id="W0008-04-0120-pa-05e7" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Si duæ res, vt duæ domus, vna vici<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>im mine<fo:inline id="W0008-04-0120-mi-051e" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
