<fo:block id="W0008-04-0126-pa-0607" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Quod ergo ad denunciationem decreti iudi<fo:inline id="W0008-04-0126-mi-053c" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
