<fo:block id="W0008-04-0161-pa-0696" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>E<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t verò hoc di<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>crimen inter primum modũ<fo:inline id="W0008-04-0161-mi-05b8" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
