<fo:block id="W0008-04-0182-pa-06d3" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>In fine eiu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>dem legis additur tertia pars interdicti, quæ prohibitoria e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t. Ea enim prohibetur,
