<fo:block id="W0008-04-0198-pa-0717" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Si animal, quod damnum dedit, moriatur an<fo:inline id="W0008-04-0198-mi-0620" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
				7] </fo:inline>te litem conte<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tatam, qua damnum à domino illius petatur, vel vt pro damno tradat animal, tũc
