<fo:block id="W0008-04-0204-d3-0667"><fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Di<fo:inline font-weight="bold">s</fo:inline>crimen inter re<fo:inline font-weight="bold">s</fo:inline>titutionem, &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="bold">s</fo:inline>atisfæctionem, &amp; num pro iniuria &amp; offen<fo:inline font-weight="bold">s</fo:inline>a, <fo:inline font-weight="bold">s</fo:inline>umptis præcisè, à damno
