<fo:inline> </fo:inline>Ducuntur, quoniam in iure, tam ciuili, quàm<fo:inline baseline-shift="super" font-size="9pt" font-weight="bold" id="#W0008-04-0242-nm-0442"><fo:basic-link color="#0a0c75" internal-destination="W0008-04-0242-nm-0442">90</fo:basic-link></fo:inline>
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>canonico, quando aliquid nomine alicuius e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t
