<fo:block id="W0008-04-0257-it-073f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0258-mi-06ac" color="#0a0c75">2</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Remi<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>io pænæ, qua multi in foro exteriori tenentur pro eodem delicto, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>iat vni, non deobligat alios a pænæ debito. Ni<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i contrarium circa aliquod
