<fo:block id="W0008-04-0279-pa-089a" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Secunda conclu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>io. Si publicani aliquid eo<fo:inline baseline-shift="super" font-size="9pt" font-weight="bold" id="#W0008-04-0279-nm-0466"><fo:basic-link color="#0a0c75" internal-destination="W0008-04-0279-nm-0466">126</fo:basic-link></fo:inline>rum, quæ lege relata præ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>cripta <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>unt, prætermittant, occultando, interficiendo, transferendo in alium locum, animalia inuenta, prætermittendo aliquid eorum, quæ ea lege facere
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>præcipiuntur, antequam animalia illa ip<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>is adiudicentur, vel in illis <fo:inline font-weight="normal">exequendis</fo:inline> fraude aliqua,
