<fo:inline> </fo:inline>examinandus ea de re <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it pænitens.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0008-04-0284-it-077d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0008-04-0286-mi-06e7" color="#0a0c75">4</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline>. Re<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>titutio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i fiat po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t tempus aliquod eam omißam,
